{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1273,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b79168113e17dff829d0867",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海的另一边……\n就好像联系着另一个世界……",
      "source_fingerprint": "371cbc6818fddff3f48dc898ddb1b1e27f240f51d37c1ff41f3dd76ba9def491",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1939232bbf6cbd3b79ac979",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "甘くない道のりでも…\r\nただ、前へ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69e025739cdd365856dc41495e8de24718fc29da68d31fd167eff9014fbbba43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18387af54471498085518c03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "しなやかに、軽やかに…\r\n猫のように駆けます…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d32e506dc0fcacc107f79c2edd9faaa0fa50603ae646a1aa0fcb6347e221e23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce58a1e1ce629187bdf77764",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どこまで走っても、服が乱れぬよう\r\n…コルセットを、引き締めて。",
      "source_fingerprint": "812d36eef753454b2f2ceaf3278f78c5065d8aeec5f22b8c3541e25bc6367bba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afeba1947ce82b30313f21b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "強く練るように、\r\n正しく焼くように…\r\nひとつひとつを、丁寧に…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34c45a5ae5c8e8e3859156b33c090f5b2000f9c4424cf1aed1569689c372e108",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f441a0875c73b24d560ae0e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングのご注文を。\r\nアナタのメニューであれば\r\n…なんなりと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94573b985ed68acdb3fc90b7802a6f8a5cd10b30f905f9dfd7d6fb3a04c9a49f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11eef50f89cb1dbcbff27fec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "往く道は、時にほろ苦く――\r\nですが…共に歩む限り、\r\n道に惑うことはないのでしょう…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d47d27ee4ae5a0156b11dc94c4050794e20372dabfd55e380ec7e315f42df87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8ee4f310c32aba4c6f3419d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "甘味のように…どんな苦難でも、\r\n寄り添い安らぎをくれる…。\r\n私にとって、アナタは――",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5a0144e9b4940fe1f315ce5f0f172ea1cd69f08dec20a4c7e449c13b3d7f423",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f587f2db5ebef8de46e3c39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "遥远的那个身影，如今……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f447479bb56676b627e4a4cd72063eab6c16cd509b38dbfdc225efe65882a4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cf336885f4bcb1891705436",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您的眼中……到底映出了什么呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "84c2787bab3096b08b020ee1bf178e9267725831675dc769775ca4415bae9e2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fb5dcd8759139eb3abdda77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これからも、共に至福の1杯を…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d08bcc5c7f4d90b1c8049e7d5e5c921caaf5dac950902e4f7e45471564d633d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3945b4b646d9cdf5392dab2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夢のような、ひとときでした…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bff457d8664c6c9485f451cfdf1f4548c1442c9a306960863841b8293b735006",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cb4feee1b0ad88b22f750b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比阴影更快……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4962c981f6bb5265b3367906929c1ba0a3643d8608480220050d7d3867ab3a35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79c51048134316d8935ddc35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变得更加深邃……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ee6a1c2c4956dba67ef7c386583915c60e40ae1cca716c9ffc3d8ed1c27549c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b94e6f78d23f0ba7e9728414",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……在。我是曼城茶座。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf319bafdc37cd07a070321c5530261699ae41ddc839dac04c348e65657fee89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a00206a45a9f71446c7090f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不断徘徊、不断彷徨、追逐着那道身影……\n终有一日，与您一起——",
      "source_fingerprint": "47a4e4ad29d7aab718e51d6f18e57acbf7ee83e9eb6628d40b8e173178b8c8d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6bcb5d7091b2223d094ddfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我……有帮上忙吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7144c0301724d4365ddf2ab933ec3bc71fe3cc32225ad24a3276f25009cd3857",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7182689dc741c51d647d7e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……下次的话……能做得更好吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba22832bdb4c809e014fe01619f8e00f0ee03dc488d33df741320596e028243e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a125bc4c4137816cce63ff04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "より、味わい深く…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba71beab15c04302f24138237c2ec295b75b56c74ec85286d7fdda28e16e5309",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d5f0c8650dcd7830e5cf387",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誰も知らない風味へ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d08850c1ed98e462c8006ca8ead0f482239af3117ddca200ebc07e9c0cc1899",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f2074ef1888f77e526c59cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "1杯の珈琲と、\r\n至福の時をアナタに…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92aa7689aa02d296020319898a4aedff2be0cc20638c2758f28809e96c8b3723",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cc1aca53004a77670521ff4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "マンハッタンカフェです…。\r\nどうぞ…ごゆるりと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bef49bb4f28f24a513ed03c173c3ad35610bd0c3ef200e2836975901c4131c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1025",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d6490af6bf8804883c3fc34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛模式，启动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca441dc7cc04b4602fb5d0c1bfb8d209aadfc907689aee243adb39340246d0bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44b0b20c6b95315feb17bfa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『成为三冠赛马娘』…此项，已作为\n“目标”而非“梦想”设定完毕。\n…与主人签约那天起就开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "569b779e8c05b0c6e5615fd1ee7faacfdba990fa916a027ee6e75ab9ab822843",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f62cef898438c79e0d313e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出発します。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a4ece5b9dddc32ab5e61e89a32731c83245ec9e506960297a935cf110870a60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6eea16ddb3d83b3f78e78a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帰還しました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76d5015233db10712604999b262e5063a8dad535dc0dd2cd8186b7163ccefdda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae8e86099ae00bffc6c3846b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "解析中――我的父亲与主人，\n脸部和声音的数据均不一致。\n…但二人的『温暖』却很相似。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b15c715b39c4a25aae27dd90ce7d603dbf50df64eca43cf487bb0dc8d9c196ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f6307af9571278a684a2c36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的房间并没有什么不完备的。\n因为今天也给『兔子人偶』下达了任务\n――看家。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4c9b34e0ad03fc5e31dc6da5a1e235f05ea1c7b6a0575a94a81eeb1619d901b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:216a38aa063bd2fecb2c1f3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\n我的新年愿望是『版本更新』\n我要提供出与去年不同的自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "843f63f9052af528e3ebacba6e1c43c8014df8bbfba994dcac5be4d159d0f688",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96ce11513f322ef243910473",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从同班同学那里收到了被称作\n“友情巧克力”的东西…是今天才有的\n特殊能源。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5709c016c1fb375bb99a095629389393be0b3d5d81de839ef97348bc844be8c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9e8fac198e08b261d690dc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也给主人准备了巧克力。\n没有依赖烹饪电器，全部都是\n我亲手做的。…请尝尝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d266aaad8bdf245858fc99b0081da58d1f16860746b97ac9e86ab473d0561de4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fad1e661f63f2a884c63cb5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "银河…如果主人就在那里\n等候着的话，那我\n就游过那条河吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9b76dcc97296ef22336265334b6a67fd786b9574b566a1877de6656c29ef7d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f6b3f1854aaf5874fc4cb86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我听说万圣节是要\n恶作剧的节日。该对主人做\n什么恶作剧好呢，请下指令。",
      "source_fingerprint": "afbf11c3bf79d43e6af6c9856dd5288886c91df7991a6fdac90c9422a94f98cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff61e12ddd0b3b8109cdb598",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各地的彩灯，以及合适的\n散步路线已确认完毕。\n…要出发吗？主人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03ebbc21528eb0ee79af0e3770d76b44cb97866586c0aba9b24e6e4d0fdf16b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b7f5e320c898dfea0cfd538",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是圣诞节，我的\n行动优先级也没有改变。\n…我要在你身边追寻梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f19f9f1e0d1c5a55db3ed576f42dba345c0cfbe2c0109c459ee2c7417840b9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e28fe499ba9ab589d346901",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fd91b1324f8787c50fab64db2cdd19a9fd7ebadd24f7298de6dead0780e4796",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a64a02fbd15826d145a6a21a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "空谈来年事，鬼都笑你痴――\n…鬼为什么要笑呢？\n是思考回路发生故障了吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "270585e76cc120e15dffe81a9c87f557a9ba90debe5089a8592adfcfa872e1c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a734e015bf9dc7aa69b53c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐。\n上位关联词检测到蛋糕。\n可以允许我准备吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "09d1a27028db0a72cb434152e497ee61cb7982800510ba1de77d6db5ff0f4b56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b127db3b9d0c50075f78c20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…请下达许可。\n请下达庆祝主人的生日，\n祝愿你能得到幸福…的许可。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b57881d4ba0d34dd7bd18ea994d10745d7196f467510b338b000158222346477",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c19d81eca5969697d8cc93e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是我的生日…偶尔会被问到\n『制造日期是什么时候？』，\n其实和我的生日是同一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a259e82f836e12ac5ca6ebfe1e3b2502a7653dcc1dae23b9a1c01b8365347bdd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e82a59b658472513baf21d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "主人，今天是我的生日。\n…愿望是能获得新的训练器具。\n…那个，可以…吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a13d2bc00e1d14a5d44772a8911734f900febdbf0986c6677750a0c8922724f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bee5cd96cc211e170538e8bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "主人，\n有通知送到了。\n请确认。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6f82860ca2b6d876283e07ddf93d40d65da9fa8437b5eba7c93af9b00c87251",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3f19429b2669c663cc492bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有礼物。\n没有发现危险物品，\n请放心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5146b04254979ce56569be4e41ce82d777ce221b507b61b06a0b97f737aec5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:950fef6bd6f720d69d3ea279",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "恭喜，主人。\n任务，已确认\n完成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc509ccfb5178f3b1aa8db259c6341b2e5944f88d10b70d95534728b50b22d29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3562ff6abaae63523a7d022",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "主人，有报告。\n是关于将要举行的活动。\n…要开始运转准备吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bb64f9fe6016763512d6373fb30bb52540ed54c2ef8f49277cce1d35f3fd63b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:797bae1bcd4e82678cc7a96b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动开始了。\n美浦波旁，可以启动。\n如有必要的话随时可以下达指令。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85adab37bbc15f311b3371abef802b9db50db71f7b2ed20c986fa2594f4a52e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
